# NAME: ParsecP2P
# AUTHOR: Horatio Xu
# FORMAT: Loon remote .lsr (policy-less)
# FORMAT-VERIFIED: 2026-10-25
# RULES: 3
# POLICY: DIRECT when importing; place before Parsec proxy rule set.
# COMPAT: PROCESS-NAME applies on macOS only; iOS/tvOS ignore the complete process conjunction.
# PORT-FALLBACK: Explicit opt-in at rule/optional/ParsecP2P-Port9000.lsr.
# WARNING: These rules cannot guarantee a P2P connection through CGNAT or restrictive firewalls.
# OFFICIAL-REVIEW: 2026-11-13; Docs/Official-Optimization-2026-11-13.md

DOMAIN,stun.parsec.app
DOMAIN,stun6.parsec.app
AND,((PROCESS-NAME,parsecd),(PROTOCOL,UDP))
